  "name": "timesfm-forecasting",
  "description": "Zero-shot time series forecasting with Google's TimesFM foundation model. Use this skill when forecasting ANY univariate time series — sales, sensor readings, stock prices, energy demand, patient vitals, weather, or scientific measurements — without training a custom model. Automatically checks system RAM/GPU before loading the model, supports CSV/DataFrame/array inputs, and returns point forecasts with calibrated prediction intervals. Includes a preflight system checker script that MUST be run before first use to verify the machine can load the model. For classical statistical time series models (ARIMA, SARIMAX, VAR) use statsmodels; for time series classification/clustering use aeon.",
